#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Seed ~20 evergreen Indian-history topics with researched summaries.

Each topic carries real source text so the LLM research stage has substance to
work with — thin reddit question-posts are what got scripts rejected. The
hourly scheduler consumes one topic per cycle: script → auto-approve → render
→ Rumble publish.

Run: .venv/bin/python tools/seed_history_topics.py
"""
